{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/skytoursmiami/items/371933/", "pk": 371933, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/skytoursmiami/", "pk": 81042, "shortname": "skytoursmiami", "name": "Sky Tours Miami", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Miami Downtown Private Airplane Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Miami Downtown Private Airplane Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 2, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 2, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": true, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 2000, "description": "#Sky Tours Miami provides breathtaking Private Airplane tours in the Miami area.\n\n##Duration\n\n30 Mins \n\n##About\nAll our tours are Private.\n\nMain Attractions to see:\n\n- Dadeland downtown \n- Botanical garden \n- Hammock park \n- Pinecrest\n- Vizcaya Museum\n- Coastal Area of Miami\n\nOur Certified Pilots have years of flying experience and a long history of sharing their passion with our customers. \n\n​Our Highly maintained and comfortable aircraft along with our friendly pilots will make your tour full of fun. \n\n\n#​Book a Private Airplane Tour with us Today and enjoy the experience of a lifetime.\n\nLet us know if you are celebrating any special occasion like a Birthday, Anniversary etc.\n\n##What's Included \n\n- Headset will be provided for the duration of the Tour\n- Complimentary Cold Drinks (Soda, water, juice only)\n- Free Wi-Fi\n- Free Parking\n- Free Birthday Balloon (If requested in advance)\n- Cessna 172 (Plane color based upon availability) \n\n##More Info \n\n- Tours take place from 7 a.m. to 9:00p.m.\n- Price is per person. Minimum of 2 people; maximum of 3 people per tour. (If you have a larger group, we can arrange different times) \n- Solo travelers Accepted (will need to purchase 2 tickets)\n- Must be 5 or older\n- Maximum weight per passenger is limited to 250 lbs.; total group weight cannot exceed 480 pounds\n- Must provide a valid ID\n- A waiver must be signed by all passengers\n- No person in any type of influence allowed at or around the property; no smoking allowed\n- For passengers with a disability, please contact the merchant prior to booking to arrange in advance\n- No outside food and drink allowed\n- Must wear comfortable shoes; no high heels or flip flops\n- Please arrive 20 minutes before the flight\n- Passengers who fail to arrive and check in at least 20 minutes before the scheduled departure time may have their tour duration reduced or considered a 'no show', with no refund.\n- The customer that paid for this booking must be present at the time of the flight with ID and credit card (no photos or copies are accepted).\n- Passengers arriving late will have their flight time shortened or asked to reschedule for another time/day with a rescheduling fee.\n- Minors must be accompanied by an adult.\n\n##Cancellation\n- If you need to cancel or reschedule, you must let us know at least 24 hours prior to your booking time in order to avoid a rescheduling fee of $50\n- No refunds for last minute cancellation.\n- No refunds for \"No-Show\" (If you miss your flight, you will be considered No-Show, and no refund will be given)\n- Full refunds will apply for flight cancellations made by Sky Tours Miami due to technical issues or any other unforeseen circumstances that could affect your flight.\n- Subject to weather\n- Flight route might change unannounced due to Air Traffic reasons.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "14005 Sw 127th St Unit 120A Miami, Fl 33186", "booking_notes": "##We look forward to seeing you!\nUpon arrival:\n- Must provide a valid ID\n- A waiver must be signed by all passengers\n- Please arrive 20 minutes before flight\n- The customer that paid for this booking must be present at the time of the flight with ID and credit card (no photos or copies are accepted).\n- No person in any type of influence allowed at or around the property; no smoking allowed\n- No outside food and drink allowed\n- Must wear comfortable shoes; no high heels or flip flops\n-Minors must be accompanied by an Adult", "cancellation_notes": "##Cancellation\n- If you need to cancel or reschedule, you must let us know at least 24 hours prior to your booking to avoid a rescheduling fee.\n- $50 Rescheduling Fee\n- No refunds for \"No-Show\" (If you miss your flight, you will be considered No-Show, and no refund will be given)\n-  Missed flights can be reschedule for another date/time . Rescheduling fees apply.\n- Full refunds will apply for flight cancellations made by Sky Tours Miami due to technical issues or any other unforeseen circumstances that could affect your flight.\n- Subject to weather\n- Flight route might change unannounced due to Air Traffic reasons.\n- Maximum weight per passenger is limited to 250 lbs; total group weight cannot exceed 480 pounds.\n- If total group weight exceeds our weight restriction your flight will be cancelled with no refunds.\n- Refunds will not be issued to passengers who decide to cancel their flight mid-air.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "30 Mins  • Up to 3 Passengers • Ages 5+", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "